---
import Layout from "../../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Counter-Strike 2 Server Hosting - QuackHost" description="Premium CS2 server hosting with 128-tick servers, custom maps, SourceMod support, and anti-DDoS protection. Perfect for competitive and casual gameplay.">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-100 via-gray-90 to-gray-100">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 lg:py-32">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50/5 via-transparent to-purple-50/5"></div>

			<div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
					<div class="inline-block mb-6 px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-50/20 to-purple-50/20 rounded-full border border-cyan-50/30">
						<span class="text-cyan-50 font-bold text-sm">COUNTER-STRIKE 2 HOSTING</span>
					</div>

					<h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-cyan-50 to-purple-50 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
						High-Performance CS2 Servers
					</h1>

					<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						Host your Counter-Strike 2 server with 128-tick performance, custom map support, SourceMod plugins, and enterprise-grade DDoS protection.
					</p>

					<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center mb-12">
						<a href="/pricing" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF9C20] to-[#FF8D00] text-black font-bold rounded-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#FF9C20]/20 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
							Get Started
						</a>
						<a href="/games" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 text-white font-bold rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-80 hover:border-[#FF9C20] transition-all duration-300">
							View All Games
						</a>
					</div>

					<!-- Quick Stats -->
					<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">2min</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Setup Time</div>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">128</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Tick Servers</div>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">100%</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Plugin Support</div>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">24/7</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Uptime</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Key Features -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							Everything You Need for CS2
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
							Professional-grade CS2 hosting with the performance and features competitive players demand.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
						<!-- Feature 1 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">⚡</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">128-Tick Servers</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Experience competitive-grade performance with 128-tick servers for the most responsive gameplay and precise hit registration.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 2 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🗺️</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Custom Maps & Workshop</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Install any custom map from the Steam Workshop with one click. Support for competitive, casual, and community maps.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 3 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🔌</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">SourceMod & MetaMod</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Full support for SourceMod and MetaMod plugins. Add admin tools, game modes, stats tracking, and custom features.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 4 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🎮</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">RCON & FTP Access</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Full RCON control for live server management. FTP access for config editing, map uploads, and plugin installation.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 5 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🛡️</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">DDoS Protection</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Enterprise-grade DDoS mitigation keeps your server online during attacks. Never forfeit a match to downtime.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 6 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-purple-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🚀</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Instant Deployment</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Your CS2 server deploys in under 2 minutes. Pre-configured competitive settings get you playing immediately.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Pricing Section -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							CS2 Server Pricing
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20">
							Affordable plans for casual servers and competitive leagues
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
						<!-- Duck Plan -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-[#FF9C20] rounded-xl p-8 relative transform scale-105">
							<div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#FF9C20] text-black text-xs font-bold rounded-full">
								RECOMMENDED
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Duck</h3>
							<div class="mb-4">
								<span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">$8</span>
								<span class="text-cool-gray-40">/month</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span><strong class="text-white">Up to 32 players</strong></span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>8GB DDR5 RAM</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>2 CPU cores (Ryzen 9 7950X3D)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>40GB NVMe storage</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>128-tick server</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>Unlimited bandwidth</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>DDoS protection</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/pricing" class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF9C20] to-[#FF8D00] text-black font-bold rounded-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#FF9C20]/20 transition-all duration-300">
								Get Started
							</a>
						</div>

						<!-- Goose Plan -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Goose</h3>
							<div class="mb-4">
								<span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">$16</span>
								<span class="text-cool-gray-40">/month</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span><strong class="text-white">Up to 64 players</strong></span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>16GB DDR5 RAM</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>4 CPU cores (Ryzen 9 7950X3D)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>80GB NVMe storage</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>128-tick server</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>Unlimited bandwidth</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>DDoS protection</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>Priority support</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/pricing" class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 text-white font-bold rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50 transition-all duration-300">
								Get Started
							</a>
						</div>

						<!-- Swan Plan -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Swan</h3>
							<div class="mb-4">
								<span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">$32</span>
								<span class="text-cool-gray-40">/month</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span><strong class="text-white">Up to 128 players</strong></span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>32GB DDR5 RAM</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>8 CPU cores (Ryzen 9 7950X3D)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>160GB NVMe storage</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>128-tick server</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>Unlimited bandwidth</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>DDoS protection</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>Priority support</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-cyan-50">✓</span>
									<span>Multiple servers</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/pricing" class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 text-white font-bold rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50 transition-all duration-300">
								Get Started
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- CS2 Note -->
					<div class="mt-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50/10 to-purple-50/10 border-2 border-cyan-50/50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
						<p class="text-white mb-2">
							<strong>CS2 Performance Note:</strong> Counter-Strike 2 is optimized and runs efficiently on all plans.
						</p>
						<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">Duck plan supports standard competitive 5v5, while larger plans handle community servers and custom game modes.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Popular Plugins Section -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							Popular CS2 Plugins
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20">
							Enhance your server with SourceMod and MetaMod plugins
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">Admin Tools</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">SourceMod admin system for player management, kicks, bans, and moderation</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Essential</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">RankMe</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Player ranking system with ELO ratings and statistics tracking</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Competitive</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">Map Manager</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Advanced map rotation and voting systems for custom map pools</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Quality of Life</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">Retakes</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Practice retake scenarios with bombsite spawns and loadouts</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Training</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">Deathmatch</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">FFA deathmatch with instant respawns and weapon menus</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Game Mode</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-cyan-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-50 mb-2">Practice Mode</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Grenade practice tools, bot placement, and utility training</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Training</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50/10 to-purple-50/10 border border-cyan-50/30 rounded-xl p-6">
						<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Installing Plugins</h3>
						<p class="text-cool-gray-20 mb-4">
							Add plugins to your CS2 server through QuackPlane:
						</p>
						<ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
							<li class="flex gap-3">
								<span class="text-cyan-50 font-bold">1.</span>
								<span>Download the plugin from AlliedModders or other trusted sources</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-3">
								<span class="text-cyan-50 font-bold">2.</span>
								<span>Upload plugin files via FTP or QuackPlane's file manager</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-3">
								<span class="text-cyan-50 font-bold">3.</span>
								<span>Restart your server to load the new plugin</span>
							</li>
						</ol>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FAQ Section -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							Frequently Asked Questions
						</h2>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
							<summary class="px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold hover:text-[#FF9C20] transition-colors">
								<span>What tick rate do CS2 servers run at?</span>
								<span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
							</summary>
							<div class="px-8 pb-6 text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								<p class="mb-4">All QuackHost CS2 servers run at <strong class="text-white">128-tick</strong> by default, matching the performance of professional competitive servers.</p>
								<p>128-tick servers update twice as frequently as 64-tick servers (128 times per second vs 64), resulting in:</p>
								<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4 mt-3">
									<li>More accurate hit registration</li>
									<li>Better movement precision</li>
									<li>Improved grenade consistency</li>
									<li>Reduced peek advantage</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</details>

						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
							<summary class="px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold hover:text-[#FF9C20] transition-colors">
								<span>Can I add custom maps to my CS2 server?</span>
								<span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
							</summary>
							<div class="px-8 pb-6 text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								<p class="mb-4">Yes! You can add any custom map through multiple methods:</p>
								<ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
									<li><strong class="text-white">Steam Workshop:</strong> Subscribe to maps on the Workshop and add their IDs to your server config</li>
									<li><strong class="text-white">Direct Upload:</strong> Upload map files via FTP to your server's maps folder</li>
									<li><strong class="text-white">QuackPlane:</strong> Use our built-in map manager to browse and install popular maps</li>
								</ol>
								<p class="mt-4">Players will automatically download maps when connecting if they don't have them installed.</p>
							</div>
						</details>

						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
							<summary class="px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold hover:text-[#FF9C20] transition-colors">
								<span>How do I configure competitive settings?</span>
								<span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
							</summary>
							<div class="px-8 pb-6 text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								<p class="mb-4">QuackPlane includes pre-configured competitive settings you can enable with one click:</p>
